abstract: >-
  The Quran Vision Corpus (v6.2.1) is a bilingual (Turkish/English) academic research corpus and interactive digital cockpit comprising 15 foundational Quranic verse monographs (QV-2026-001 through QV-2026-015). Each report follows a standardized 26-step methodological protocol across 5 macro-phases and 5 mandatory appendices (Z-1 to Z-5), bridging 76 primary Arabic classical tafsir citations (verified under the ISNAD 2nd Edition standard) with 45 contemporary empirical datasets (World Bank, UNDP, WJP, UNESCO, SIPRI, OECD, WHO via APA 7 / DOI) and 10-year quantitative Bayesian scenario simulations (2026–2036).
